ws.com/i/Baystar_by_Vida_at_Rashid_Yachts_Emaar_Waterfront_Living_d5a786ef7d.jpg","hash":"Baystar_by_Vida_at_Rashid_Yachts_Emaar_Waterfront_Living_d5a786ef7d","name":"Baystar by Vida at Rashid Yachts | Emaar Waterfront Living "},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Baystar_by_Vida_at_Rashid_Yachts_Emaar_Waterfront_Living_6b5b45de6f.jpg","hash":"Baystar_by_Vida_at_Rashid_Yachts_Emaar_Waterfront_Living_6b5b45de6f","name":"Baystar by Vida at Rashid Yachts | Emaar Waterfront Living "}],"images":[],"characteristics_module":{"id":1679,"cta":{"id":2464,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Find out more","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Baystar_by_Vida_at_Rashid_Yachts_Emaar_Waterfront_Living_16e1f97bd7.jpg","hash":"Baystar_by_Vida_at_Rashid_Yachts_Emaar_Waterfront_Living_16e1f97bd7","name":"Baystar by Vida at Rashid Yachts | Emaar Waterfront Living "},"style":null,"title":"Waterfront elegance meets five-star comfort","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li><strong>First VIDA-Branded Project in the Marina</strong><br>Emaar Baystar is the only VIDA-branded residential development in Rashid Yachts &amp; Marina, offering hotel-inspired living in a residential setting.</li><li><strong>Iconic Waterfront Twin Towers</strong><br>Two sleek towers feature spacious apartments with floor-to-ceiling windows, open layouts, and marina-facing balconies.</li><li><strong>Direct Access to the Marina Promenade</strong><br>Enjoy a front-row seat to luxury with yacht berthing, a floating yacht club, and walkable access to the marina’s vibrant promenade.</li><li><strong>Hotel-Style Services by VIDA</strong><br>Concierge, valet, and housekeeping services elevate daily life with the effortless convenience of VIDA’s hospitality experience.</li><li><strong>Resort-Inspired Amenities</strong><br>From an infinity pool and yoga platforms to landscaped gardens and wellness zones, every corner is designed for leisure and balance.</li><li><strong>Prime Location &amp; Prestige</strong><br>Strategically located minutes from Downtown Dubai and DXB Airport, while neighboring the iconic Queen Elizabeth 2 hotel, Baystar offers unmatched connectivity and a legacy address.</li><li><strong>Yacht-Centric Masterplan</strong><br>Home to 430+ yacht berths (up to 100m), a floating yacht club, and a 500m resort-style canal pool.</li><li><strong>Retail, Dining &amp; Culture</strong><br>13,900 sqm of shopping and dining, plus the iconic QE2 Hotel and theatre nearby.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1680,"cta":{"id":2465,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Baystar_by_Vida_at_Rashid_Yachts_Emaar_Waterfront_Living_7a42173a95.jpg","hash":"Baystar_by_Vida_at_Rashid_Yachts_Emaar_Waterfront_Living_7a42173a95","name":"Baystar by Vida at Rashid Yachts | Emaar Waterfront Living "},"style":null,"title":"Seaside serenity, Downtown proximity","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Set in the prestigious Rashid Yachts &amp; Marina at Mina Rashid, Baystar by VIDA offers panoramic views of the marina and Arabian Gulf, just minutes away from Downtown Dubai, Dubai Mall, and DXB Airport.</p><ul><li>10 Minutes – Sheikh Zayed Road</li><li>15 Minutes – Al Fahidi Historical District</li><li>18 Minutes – Dubai International Airport</li><li>20 Minutes – Downtown Dubai</li><li>20 Minutes - Dubai Creek Harbour</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":4188,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Baystar_by_Vida_at_Rashid_Yachts_Emaar_Waterfront_Living_2df175ae8a.pdf","has