 blends coastal elegance with VIDA’s boutique hospitality, offering an elevated marina lifestyle.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is Baystar by Vida?"},{"id":7934,"answer":"<p>Baystar by Vida at Rashid Yachts &amp; Marina is ideally located near Downtown Dubai and Dubai International Airport. It offers direct access to the marina promenade, yacht berths, and the iconic Queen Elizabeth 2 hotel.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the Baystar by Vida location?"},{"id":7935,"answer":"<p>You can choose from 1, 2, 3, or 4-bedroom apartments, all with open layouts, modern finishes, and private balconies overlooking the marina.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What types of units are available?"},{"id":7936,"answer":"<p>Baystar by Vida offers a flexible 80/20 post-handover payment plan spread across construction milestones. Buyers pay 10% on booking, followed by six 10% installments from September 2025 to October 2028, aligned with construction progress. The remaining 20% is due upon 100% completion in December 2029.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the payment plan for Baystar by Vida?"},{"id":7937,"answer":"<p>Emaar Baystar by Vida is developed by Emaar Properties, one of Dubai’s most trusted developers, known for premium quality and timely delivery.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Who developed Emaar Baystar by Vida?"},{"id":7938,"answer":"<p>Baystar amenities include an infinity pool, wellness zones, landscaped gardens, a modern gym, yoga decks, kids’ play areas, and hotel-style services like concierge, valet, and housekeeping.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What are the Baystar amenities?"},{"id":7939,"answer":"<p>The handover for Baystar by Vida at Rashid Yachts &amp; Marina is expected in the near future. You can register your interest for updates on launch and delivery timelines.</p>","question":"When is the handover for Baystar by Vida?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":[],"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"ht